+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Paint icon performance</title>
+<style>body{margin:24px;background:#0b141b;color:#edf1f2;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1720px;margin:auto}a{color:#ffda45}p{line-height:1.5;max-width:1100px}img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #344750}select{padding:10px;background:#12212a;color:white;border:1px solid #526773}.chart{max-width:850px}.bar{height:26px;margin:6px 0 18px;background:#ffda45;min-width:4px}.old{background:#788e9b}.warm{background:#66c78b}.item{margin-top:18px}.value{float:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}</style>
+<main><h1>Paint icon performance</h1><p>One model generates the uncached icons; persisted 2D images serve later visits. The accepted row layout and profile-style cars stay the same.</p>
+<p><a href="../../GARAGE_PAINT_ICON_PERFORMANCE_2026_10_26.md">Implementation and validation</a> · <a href="report.json">Commands, raw metrics and hashes</a> · <a href="task-only.patch">Scoped checkpoint</a></p>
+<label>Desktop renderer <select id="renderer"><option value="gl_compatibility">Compatibility</option><option value="mobile">Vulkan Mobile</option></select></label>
+<h2>Full 49-icon catalogue</h2><div class="chart"><div class="item">Previous Compatibility — 49 models<span class="value">12.317 s</span></div><div class="bar old" style="width:100%"></div><div class="item">New, empty cache — one model<span class="value" id="cold-value"></span></div><div class="bar" id="cold"></div><div class="item">New, disk cache — zero models<span class="value" id="warm-value"></span></div><div class="bar warm" id="warm"></div></div>
+<p>Windows diagnostics, with final renderer benchmarks concurrent. Cold first-use construction/shader hitches remain; cache reuse removes repeated icon builds. These are not physical-phone measurements or full Garage-startup timings.</p>
